Z||000000||Chris Schaefer||08-12-2000||01:55 PM||||Just wanted to let everyone on this list aware of a Fiero show coming up in September. <BR>The date of the show is Sept. 23.<BR>Cars star arriving on site at 8:30am.<BR>The place is Rutland, MA.<BR>After the awards, about 1:45pm, there will be a cruise to Kick Hill Farm in Lebanon, CT.<BR>You may contact myself of Tim Perrigo at "tim@fieroparts.com" for more information.<P><P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Old Lar||08-12-2000||11:21 PM||||What is the address of the Rutland Community Center? I've been to the show the past couple of years, and Rutland's a pretty town...pretty small and located sort of out of the way. Easy to find, but easy to get lost. I'm trying to get my directions through Yahoo Map or one of those map web pages. <P>Do you have any motel recommendations in the area?  Last year I stayed in Leominster.<P>How about motel recommendations near Kick Hill Farms?<P>Never hurts to put show notices on the main forum.  It brings it to everyones attention.||||reg||1
